    flip_block expects changes [["remove: the coin was confirmed in block 850000"], ["remove: the spending transaction is in block 862960"], ["remove: the witness contains a signature by key 1"], ["remove: the witness contains a signature by key 3"]].

scenario lost_key_3 is, as stated in the flip analysis of the policy:
